## The Creative Storytellers of Our Space Club

The Media and Public Relations Division is the creative studio behind SEDS Sri Lanka. Every time our engineering divisions build a rover, launch a weather balloon, or host a stargazing night, our media team is there to capture the moment.

If you love photography, graphic design, video editing, writing, or managing social media, this division gives you a creative outlet to practice your skills and share our club activities with thousands of students.

## What We Do in Our Club

### 1. Photography and Event Videography
We bring cameras and tripods to every major club event and field trip:
- Taking sharp photos of students building prototypes, soldering circuits, and looking through telescopes
- Recording video highlights, interviews with team members, and behind-the-scenes build logs
- Editing fun short-form video reels for Instagram, TikTok, and YouTube

### 2. Graphic Design and Visual Branding
We create all the visual artwork that gives our club and projects their personality:
- Designing event flyers, workshop posters, and announcement graphics using Canva, Photoshop, and Figma
- Creating commemorative mission patch stickers, club t-shirt graphics, and social media banners
- Making clean infographics that explain cool space facts and club achievements

### 3. Writing, Storytelling, and Social Media
We keep our student community and followers up to date:
- Writing friendly blog posts, event recaps, and newsletter articles
- Managing our Facebook, LinkedIn, and Instagram pages to answer student questions and share upcoming workshops
- Writing simple press releases to help local newspapers and student magazines cover our activities

## What You Get as a Student Member

- Build a Creative Portfolio: Get your photos, graphics, videos, and articles published and seen by a large audience.
- Master Creative Software: Learn to use professional design and video editing tools like Adobe Premiere, Lightroom, and Figma with peer guidance.
- Close-Knit Creative Team: Work alongside friendly designers, photographers, and writers who love brainstorming fun ideas.
